WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.820
I killed a woman the other night.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.580
I didn't feel any guilt

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.100
or remorse.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.440
I just felt...

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.000
Empty.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.380
Is that how you feel?

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.800
No.

00:00:31.935 --> 00:00:34.265
People aren't who you think they are.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.196
They're someone else too.

00:00:36.196 --> 00:00:38.000
Someone you don't get to see.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.720
What's going on?

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.880
It's cop stuff, sweetheart.

00:00:49.775 --> 00:00:51.305
You weren't supposed to kill her.

00:00:52.025 --> 00:00:54.795
I don't know what to tell you. It wasn't my fault.

00:00:58.395 --> 00:00:59.935
Nobody steals from the cartel.

00:01:00.415 --> 00:01:03.015
You caused this. You'll work it off.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.140
I can't do that.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.340
Are you in trouble?

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.000
I don't really feel like talking about it.

00:01:13.785 --> 00:01:15.075
Do you trust him?

00:01:15.805 --> 00:01:16.805
Yes.

00:01:17.285 --> 00:01:18.285
Good.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.500
Because I see beautiful things in him.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.400
Society's falling.

00:01:32.305 --> 00:01:34.165
It's all collapsing around us.

00:01:35.955 --> 00:01:39.265
Soon our cities will be washed away by floods,

00:01:40.905 --> 00:01:42.105
buried in sand,

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:45.460
burned to the ground.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:50.780
That's why you found me.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.320
As the world fractures

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.620
someone has to be there to protect innocence.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:07.700
I want the worst guys you got.

